      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOVE BUG GIBLET (8) could manage only second at this track last time but caught the eye when posting a slick 22.66 over 400m at Geelong the start prior. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. BROTHER BUB (1) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 3.5 lengths away in second (22.32) at this track in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win over 390m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to be in the finish again. PAW KACEY (3) resumed in a Mix 6/7 at this track and finished fifth over 390m (22.53). Will be much improved. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Must be included in calculations. LACRIMAL (2) showed great speed to lead all the way last start. Big chance again.",
